heading('Recorded checks');p('The documented run completed on CPU, selected the checkpoint by validation loss, then evaluated once on the held-out test set. The ONNX export was compared with PyTorch logits and passed the recorded parity check. The report charts and metric values are generated from the saved evaluation artifacts.')
heading('Limits of reproducibility');p('The exact file lists and seed are recorded, but the random image split may still contain near-duplicate or repeated-object images across subsets. Hardware and dependency versions can affect training time and may cause small numerical differences. Test results describe this dataset and split only; they are not a field-performance estimate.')
